All signs not expressly permitted under this chapter 28A are prohibited. Such signs include but are not limited to:
(1) Banners, except as authorized in section 16-28A.012(a)(5) and 16-28A.007;
(2) Beacons, except as authorized in section 16-28A.007(a);
(3) Pennants;
(4) Strings of lights not permanently mounted to a rigid background, except as authorized in section 16-28A.008(3);
(5) Inflatable signs;
(6) Balloons, except as authorized in section 16-28A.007(a);
(7) Roof signs; and
(8) Rotating signs.
(Ord. No. 2015-54(15-O-1394), § 1(Att. A), 11-11-15)
